{"unit_id":"zeta987__dsh-roles-zeta#card-zh","repo":"zeta987/dsh-roles-zeta","commit":"25ba079dda17898f3f5ff7015d0775a000c3e475","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-roles-zeta 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的角色式子代理委派插件。它在 DSH 的 subagents 服务上注册 delegate 工具，角色文件为每个子代理指定 persona、模型路线、推理强度和可见工具。用户可按角色委派独立任务，并可选择前台或后台运行；插件还可为角色提供斜杠命令、Web 设置页及角色目录变更监听。首次加载时可将内置角色写入 DSH home 的 agents 目录，后续读取和管理这些角色文件。适合需要固定职责、模型路线或工具范围来组织子代理工作的 DSH 用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:554-557","lib/index.js:629-652","lib/index.js:780-801"]}
{"unit_id":"zeta987__dsh-roles-zeta#card-en","repo":"zeta987/dsh-roles-zeta","commit":"25ba079dda17898f3f5ff7015d0775a000c3e475","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-roles-zeta adds role-based subagent delegation to DSH Web. A delegate tool starts a named role whose file defines persona, model route, reasoning effort, and tools. Tasks run in the foreground or background. Optional surfaces provide slash commands, a Web settings page, and role-file watching.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:554-557","lib/index.js:629-652","lib/index.js:780-801"]}
